161		// even when UserPromptSubmit doesn't (e.g., droid exec mode).
162		// The user-prompt-submit handler gracefully handles SessionStart's stdin format
163		// (userPromptSubmitRaw is a superset of sessionInfoRaw; Prompt defaults to "").
